WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Design review. Notice what changes and what stays the same.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.000
LEARNING TARGET: Present a supported concept and limits

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:38.000
THE BIG IDEA: A design review summarizes the model, evidence, assumptions, risks and next measurement. The conclusion should match the evidence strength.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:45.000
WORKED EXAMPLE: State one conclusion, one supporting result, one limitation and one next test rather than calling a sketch “safe.”

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:52.000
PAUSE AND PREDICT: Oral defense

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:59.000
MODEL LIMIT: A system diagram is a model, not a finished vehicle or proof of roadworthiness.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:06.000
TAKEAWAY: Present a supported concept and limits
